rewrite h00 h40 h90 h140 h190 h240 h163 h663 h1163 h1663 h2163.
rewrite h620 h020 h520 h1020 h1520 h2020 h219 h719 h1219 h1719 h2219.
rewrite h1221 h121 h621 h1121 h1621 h2121 h320 h820 h1320 h1820 h2320.
rewrite /keccak_lane_of_int /keccak_lane_bit /keccak_word_bit
        /keccak_word_norm /keccak_lane_bits /=.
by rewrite !nth_mkseq; 1..2: by smt().
qed.

